        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Action result:\n{\"end_offset\":317,\"next_offset\":null,\"offset\":0,\"path\":\"sequences.py\",\"sha256\":\"89ebbc20cfbb57a9a80d4e09f77572bdc8e40d1a49ca002f7deecff59a91e130\",\"size_bytes\":317,\"text\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"Small sequence transformations.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef stable_unique(values):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Keep the first occurrence of each equality-distinct value.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    raise NotImplementedError(\\\"stable_unique\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef reversed_copy(values):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Return reversed values without modifying the input sequence.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return list(reversed(values))\\n\"}\nReturn the next JSON action.",
